<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Bible Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">FIDIMONI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fdm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Fidimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda kwena Fidimoni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda kwena Fidimoni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Fidimoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Fidimoni kenina nduku wa thumwa Pholu. Pholu kámusamwana Musamu wa Bukheti ku nima, wákituka mukidisitu. Mukyedika kenina mvwama. Kákala yi bahika. Onezimi, mosi wa bahika ba Fidimoni, wátina kwena pfumu wandi. Kámuwana Pholu muna boloku mwamuna kákala. Wákituka mukidisitu yandi phi. Pholu wámuvutula Onezimi kwena pfumu wandi yi mukanda hana moku. Abweti Fidimoni kamúyambila Onezimi?</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda wa Pholu kwena Fidimoni wutadidini phi kimvuka kina kyisi khundakanina muna nzu yandi (nzila 2). Wubati zonzila dyambu dimosi ditadidini kimvuka kya muthu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muna tangwa meni dyadina, kimvwama kya bisi Loma kyákala mu kikhita kya bahika. Ndambu mosi ya batu ba mulambu wawuna benina bahika. Babati sala muna bisalu byosu amana luzingu lwa bawu lwosu ha moku ma bapfumu ba bawu. Kutina kwa muhika bisikwa hanina ndola mosi ya ngolu, mbala za hika mu lufwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muna mukanda wandi, Pholu kabati lomba kwena Fidimoni mu kumutambula Onezimi hanga phangi watondama. Kikuma boosu, yi batu bana bakondi kala bahika yi bahika, benina baphangi mwena Kidisitu. Kaasi Pholu kabatiku hana muswa kwena Fidimoni. Wuzodini ni Fidimoni kabonga lukanu yandi meni mu mana kasála.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakidisitu ba theti báfwanaku kedi mu kubalumuna mutindu wa luzingu lwa bawu muna mbala mosi. Kaasi lukwikilu mwena Yesu Kidisitu lubalumuni mutindu wa kuzingila muna mbala mosi. Ndinga ya lungongu yenina yi ndandu muna luzingu lwa kingenga yi luzingu lwa batu boosu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Yandu meni Pholu, bákotisa mu boloku kikuma kya Kidisitu Yesu yi phangi Thimoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Kwena ngeyi Fidimoni, watondama yi musindikidi wetu wa kisalu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>yi kwena Aphiya, phangi wetu wa mukhetu, kwena Adisiphi, musindikidi wetu wa mizingu, yi kwena Dibundu dina dyisi khundakana muna nzu yaku: <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Yambula Nzambi Tata wetu yi Pfumu wetu Yesu Kidisitu baluheka khenda yi ngemba.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lungongu yi lukwikilu lwa Fidimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Mbala zoosu zina yisi vutula matondu kwena Nzambi wama, yisi tumbula zina dyaku Fidimoni muna bisambu byama. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Mukuma yisi yuka khululuka ya lungongu lwaku kikuma kya bakwikidi boosu yi lukwikilu lwaku kwena Pfumu Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Yisi lomba kwena Nzambi ni lukwikilu luna wenina lwawu mu kithwadi yi betu, lwakala ngolu mwena ngeyi ndangu lwasongila mamboti mana tufwani mu kulungisa kikuma kya Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Kikuma, zola dyaku, phangi, dipheki kyesi kya lawu yi kikesa, mukuma wusyamisini mbundu ya bakwikidi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wulombi lusadisu kikuma kya Onezimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Yihana ni, mbatanana yenina yi muswa mu kithwadi yi Kidisitu mu kukusenda mana wulungini mu kuhanga, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>kaasi nzodi yikulomba kima kimosi muna zina dya lungongu. Bwosu yekina, meni Pholu, kinunu, amana phi buthwena mu boloku yenina kikuma kya Kidisitu Yesu, <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>mbati kulomba lusadisu kikuma kya Mwana wama Onezimi. Yandi Kenina mwana wama wuna mbutidini muna boloku. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Theti, kákalaku mupfunu kwena ngeyi, kaasi buthwena bwabu, mupfunu katuyekina kwena ngeyi yi meni.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Buthwena, yikuvutwadi yandi, yandi wenina hanga ndambu ya meni meni. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Yizodi ni kakala bela-bela yi meni ndangu katsadisaka ha kifulu kya ngeyi, muna tangwa dyadi yenina mu boloku kikuma kya Musamu wa Bukheti. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Kaasi nzodikiku ni yihanga kima konda wapheka nzila, ndangu wuhangaku mambu mu kingolu-ngolu kaasi yi mbundu ya bukheti.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Ngatu Onezimi káyekukila kwena ngeyi kikuma kya tangwa dya khunda, ndangu kakuvutwakila kyamakulu, <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>kakalaku hanga muhika wa ngeyi, kaasi wekina kuhita muhika: phangi mosi watondama. Mukuma kenina kwena meni, hanga phangi watondama, kakálabwa hika kwena ngeyi phi phangi watondama, hanga mutu, hanga phi phangi mwena Kidisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Yuka ni wisi mbongila hanga nduku waku, mubonga yandi phi bwosu wisi mbongila meni. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Yuka ni mbi kákuhanga, kondi loni pfuka yaku kenina yawu, syabya mu mutwa wa meni. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Yi koku dya meni meni mbati sonikina mambu mama: Meni Pholu, yikúvutwalabya. Nzodiku yikuyubululabwa ni ngeyi pfuka ya meni wenina yawu, luzingu lwaku yáta. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Kyedika, Phangi wama, tsadisa bwabuna kikuma kya lungongu lwa Pfumu: ndembika mbundu mukuma ngeyi yi meni kima kimosi thwenina mwena Kidisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Tsini mbundu ni muna tangwa dyadidi mbati kusonikina, wahánga kuhita hika buna yikulombini. Nzayi mboti ni wahángabwa hika kuluta. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Amana muna mbala mosi, yikulombi hika ni wangidikila mwanza, mukuma yenina yi kikwamina ni muna bisambu byenu nzila yakhángwakila ndangu yisa luvutwakila hika.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboti za tsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Ephafwasi, yandi wenina hakimosi yi meni mu boloku kikuma kya Kidisitu Yesu, mboti kakuhekini; <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Malaku, Adisitadiki, Temasi yi Luka, basindikidi bama ba kisalu, bawu phi mboti bakuhekini.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Yambula khenda za Pfumu Yesu Kidisitu zakala yi kitembu kyenu!<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
